<title>USA: TransNet Corp optimistic about Q2.</title>
<headline>TransNet Corp optimistic about Q2.</headline>
<dateline>BRANCHBURG, N.J. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransNet Corp said on Tuesday that it has set new monthly revenue records with October sales and that it is optimistic about the second quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;In addition, TransNet has been awarded new contracts, which we anticipate will significantly increase our technical service and support revenues in 1997,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Earlier on Tuesday, the company reported that earnings for the first quarter ended September 30 were $0.06 per share, up from $0.05 a year ago.</p>
